// CalculatedTableColumn. SemanticError (5) The column is in an error state because of an invalid expression.
// The column is not queryable. This state applies only to columns of the type Calculated or
// CalculatedTableColumn. EvaluationError (6) The column is in an error state because of an error during
// expression evaluation. The column is not queryable. This state applies only to columns of the type
// Calculated or CalculatedTableColumn. DependencyError (7) The column is in an error state because some of its
// calculation dependencies are in an error state. The column is not queryable. This state applies only to
// columns of the type Calculated or CalculatedTableColumn. Incomplete (8) Some parts of the column have no
// data, and the column needs to be refreshed to bring the data in. The column is queryable. This state applies
// only to columns of the type Data. SyntaxError (9) The column is in an error state because of a syntax error
// in its expression. The column is not queryable. This state applies only to columns of the type Calculated.
